fields.value:
{{Rootnotes
| name = Swashbuckle
| desc = [[Root]] sources do not interrupt the ability if already dashing.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Immediately cancels {{A|Pangolier|Rolling Thunder}} or {{Symbol|bonus shd}} {{A|Pangolier|Roll Up}} upon cast.
** Does not {{M|disjoint}} incoming {{M|projectiles}}.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*#* Sets Pangolier's {{M|main attack damage|text=main}} and {{M|bonus attack damage}} to the given values while active, despite not displayed on the [[HUD]]. This is defined as:
*#** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|SlashDmg {{=}} {{#var:Swashbuckle value5}} + ({{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Pangolier|v4r}}|tal|x}} × Σ[[Attack Damage|AtkDmg]])}}
*#*** {{cf|talnotes}} The {{ValueColor||instant attack damage bonus|25tal}} {{M|talent|t=t4r}} immediately updates the remaining slashes' damage value of the current cast.
*#** Does not affect {{M|conditional attack damage}} sources.
*#* {{Symbol|Projectile|Run}}
*#** Dashes toward the {{Symbol|Target|Point}} point-targeted location at {{#var:Swashbuckle basic1}}-speed, over {{M|impassable terrain}} and {{M|trees}}.
*#** Applies a self {{Symbol|Stun}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|pangolier_swashbuckle_[[stun]]ned}} during both the dash and the {{#expr:({{#var:Swashbuckle value3}}-1)*{{#var:Swashbuckle value4}}}}-second slash duration.
*# {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}} {{to}} [[File:Dota2 Pangolier Swashbuckle Visualization icon-1.png|84px]][[File:Dota2 Pangolier Swashbuckle Visualization icon-2.png|84px]]
*#* Applies the first [[instant attack]] instance to all enemy units Pangolier dashes through, along Line [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|O|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] .
*#** Even though the attack radius during a dash is set to 0, this instant attack component is still applied due to Pangolier intersecting with the enemy unit's {{M|bound radius}}.
*#* Upon reaching the {{Symbol|Target|Point}} point-targeted location [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] , Pangolier immediately applies {{#var:Swashbuckle value3}} instant attacks on all affected enemy units in {{#var:Swashbuckle value4}}-second intervals, at the {{Symbol|Target|Vector}} vector-targeted direction.
*#** Can affect enemy units at max {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#expr:{{#var:Swashbuckle value1}}+{{#var:Swashbuckle value2}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1l}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Swashbuckle value1 tal}}+{{#var:Swashbuckle value2}}}}|10tal}})-distance away with the slash range [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|Q]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]] {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}} and slash width.
*#* {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
*#** All instant attack components proc {{M|attack modifiers}} and {{M|on-cast effects}} as per normal.
*#*** {{Symbol|Cleave}}
*#**** [[Cleave]] damage instances are applied on the affected enemy's position, damaging a [[Wikipedia:trapezoid|trapezoid]] area the opposite direction where the attacks came from.
*#***** {{Symbol|Attack Damage}} {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}} {{Symbol|Facing Angle|l}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{Symbol|Target|Cleave90|size=42px}}
*#*** Utilizes the proc chance for {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{A|Pangolier|Lucky Shot}}.
*#** Has {{M|True Strike}}.
*#** Not affected by {{M|disarm}} sources.
*#** Does not proc {{M|damage block}} sources.
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|pangolier_swashbuckle_slow}}

* {{Symbol|fx|s}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Ethereal}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** Does not hit [[ethereal]]-affected enemy units despite the ability's sound effects.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Swashbuckle icon0}}
| desc = Pangolier dashes along the target line, then slashes and briefly slows all enemies in the drawn direction with several quick swipes.<br><br>Lucky Shot has a chance to activate from this damage.
}}
* For {{M|ranged}} heroes, although the Swashbuckle {{M|instant attack}} do not use attack {{M|projectiles}}, but are still considered ranged attacks.

